staging system for multiple myeloma. Correlation of measured myeloma cell mass with presenting clinical features, response to treatment and survival</article-title><source>Cancer</source><year>1975</year><volume>36</volume><fpage>842</fpage><lpage>854</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">1182674</pub-id><pub-id pub-id-type="doi">10.1002/1097-0142(197509)36:3&#x0003c;842::AID-CNCR2820360303&#x0003e;3.0.CO;2-U</pub-id></citation></ref></ref-list></back></article>